<title>RUSSIA: Russia UES shares up 7.4 pct to record $0.4000.</title>
<headline>Russia UES shares up 7.4 pct to record $0.4000.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Russian national electricity company UES rose 7.4 percent to a record $0.4000 at 1110 GMT on Wednesday after closing on Tuesday $0.3724 and reported volume on the shares was $27.7 million.</p>
<p>Brokers said a flow of new funds in third quarter allocations were boosting shares in leading names on the Russian Trading System.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
